  "title": "Avidbank Holdings, Inc. Announces Financial Results for the Fourth Quarter and Full Year of 2025",
  "summary": "SAN JOSE, CA / ACCESS Newswire / January 29, 2026 / Avidbank Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ:AVBH) (the \"Company\" or \"Avidbank Holdings\"), the holding company for Avidbank, a California state-chartered bank (the \"Bank\"), announced net income for the fourth quarter of 2025 of $6.9 million, or $0.65 per diluted share, compared to a net loss of $37.7 million, or ($4.12) per diluted share, for the third quarter of 2025 and net income of $6.5 million, or $0.84 per diluted share, for the fourth quarter of 2024",
